      "reviewer": "OpenAI Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-25T10:04:04Z",
      "note": "The first rfWFTM transaction in the Reaper attacker campaign is 0x24770e10...57e9 at block 44045563 index 1. Its trace contains five direct calls to redeem(uint256,address,address), each naming receiver 0x2c177d20...a954 and a different owner; all five owners have zero allowance to caller 0x8162a5e1...0145 at block 44045562. Three campaign receipts contain 14 matching Withdraw events and exactly 1003068.399671123969333133 WFTM; later withdrawals to safe 0x539ef36c...88e0 are rescue activity. Creation transaction 0xab4b0e0e...81c5 made the direct vault at block 41553220 index 3. Code is empty one block earlier, and the 16,821-byte runtime hash 0x3299492e...d3ffc4 is identical at creation, a midpoint, and the pre-exploit block. EIP-1967 implementation, beacon and admin slots are zero, and the exploit trace has no DELEGATECALL from the vault. The code age is 2,979,580 seconds. USD uses the nearest DefiLlama WFTM price, $0.32098566391252636 at timestamp 1659416649."
    }
